(text "DATA WIRING ONLY - NOT A COMPLETE WORKING NVLINK IMPLEMENTATION" (at 25 208 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left)) (uuid "9eca3e1f-d79c-52a0-a6a2-e0f1b8e72545"))
(text "External NVLink clock required on EVERY V100: 156.25 MHz differential / Connector B E20=P, F20=N.\nSeparate PCIe clock: 100 MHz differential / Connector A E7=P, F7=N. Clock circuits are not included.\nUse suitable source/fanout outputs per GPU; also provide the required supplies, reset and supporting controls." (at 25 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left)) (uuid "c02eb94e-84b0-5e2e-8610-42210ec44667"))
(text "REFERENCE SCOPE" (at 25 237 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "a3570771-a7d7-5a69-9e96-77fd56efa2ff"))
(text "Four-GPU logical plan allocates two NVHS groups per peer.\nThis complete topology is not claimed as hardware-tested. Physical connector orientation and mating footprints require confirmation.\nCurated from the credited community sources; see the repository sources, connection guide and standalone workbook." (at 25 247 0) (effects (font (size 1.143 1.143)) (justify left)) (uuid "4cc0107b-0832-5b50-bf97-6d4e13ab9d61"))
